1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
POV: You have one day in Hanoi.

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,440
This is the move.

3
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:04,160
First stop: Dong Xuan Market.

4
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,280
Breakfast first.

5
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:06,120
Then snack, shop,

6
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,920
and get lost in the Old Quarter.

7
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:08,640
Late morning?

8
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,080
Make a loop around Hoan Kiem Lake.

9
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:10,960
No rush. Just vibes.

10
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:13,760
Grab egg coffee
or an iced Vietnamese coffee.

11
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:14,560
Afternoon reset:

12
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:17,160
Temple of Literature.

13
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,480
Quiet, photogenic,

14
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:20,720
and a total break
from the traffic.

15
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:21,400
Golden hour?

16
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,240
St. Joseph's Cathedral
+ the French Quarter.

17
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,800
Instant

18
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,680
postcard energy.

19
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,480
Finish with Train Street

20
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:28,960
or a street-food crawl.

21
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,240
Quick note:

22
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,880
check access before you go,

23
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:34,800
respect the neighborhood,
and stay flexible.

24
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,400
Save this one-day Hanoi route.

25
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,560
Send it to your

26
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,920
friend who still has zero plans.
